{"text": "When the king woke up in the morning, a strange bearded man was looking at him from the bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Forgive me, the man said in a weak voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not know you, and I have nothing to forgive you for, answered the king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You do not know me, but I know you, I am your enemy, and I swore to take revenge on you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You put my brother to death and took away my land, so I have hated you ever since. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I heard that you had come alone to the hermit, I hid in the woods to attack you on your way home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But you did not come back, so I came out to look for you, and your bodyguards recognized me and wounded me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I escaped from them, but I would have died if you had not cared for my wound. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I wanted to kill you, but you have saved my life, Now I will serve you faithfully, and so will my sons. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king was very glad to make peace with his enemy so easily, and he forgave the man at once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also promised to send his own doctor and servants to him, and to give back his property.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "o", "k", "e", " ", "u", "p", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "r", "d", "e", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", "g", "i", "v", "e", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "w", "e", "a", "k", " ", "v"